{
	"name": "Channeled Power",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th level, your acolyte gains the ability to channel divine power in a small area. Enemies within 15ft take an amount of radiant damage equal to the acolyte’s Wisdom modifier and must make a Constitution save or take 1 ongoing radiant damage for up to 1 minute with an additional saving throw at the end of each turn to end the effect. Allies within the area instead gain expertise on their next attack roll, skill check, or saving throw within the next minute and ongoing healing of 2 for 3 rounds.</p><p>Your acolyte may use this ability twice per long rest.</p>",
